Quoted values and titles retain a non-punctuation backslash

```
[a](/u "t\zu")
.
<p><a href="/u" title="t\zu">a</a></p>
```

```
[a]{k="t\zu"}
.
<p><span k="t\zu">a</span></p>
```

```
[a](/u "t\}u")
.
<p><a href="/u" title="t}u">a</a></p>
```

```
[a]{k="t\}u"}
.
<p><span k="t}u">a</span></p>
```

```
[a](/u "t\\u")
.
<p><a href="/u" title="t\u">a</a></p>
```

```
[a]{k="t\\u"}
.
<p><span k="t\u">a</span></p>
```

```
[a](/u 't\zu')
.
<p><a href="/u" title="t\zu">a</a></p>
```

```
[a]{k='t\zu'}
.
<p><span k="t\zu">a</span></p>
```

```
[a](/u 't\}u')
.
<p><a href="/u" title="t}u">a</a></p>
```

```
[a]{k='t\}u'}
.
<p><span k="t}u">a</span></p>
```

```
[a](/u 't\\u')
.
<p><a href="/u" title="t\u">a</a></p>
```

```
[a]{k='t\\u'}
.
<p><span k="t\u">a</span></p>
```
